    "perplexity": {
      "description": "The Best Of Judas Priest is a career-spanning compilation that surveys Judas Priest’s long run as one of heavy metal’s defining bands, collecting key tracks from across their catalogue on Sony Music/Epic and Legacy for its 2026 release. The set highlights the group’s evolution from early hard rock roots into the sharper, more aggressive sound that helped shape metal’s mainstream vocabulary.\n\nThe collection brings together some of Priest’s best-known songs, including “You’ve Got Another Thing Coming,” “Breaking the Law,” “Living After Midnight,” “Electric Eye,” and “Painkiller,” along with deeper cuts and signature favorites such as “Beyond the Realms of Death,” “The Sentinel,” and “Diamonds and Rust.” Available in CD and vinyl formats, the compilation is designed as an accessible overview of the band’s most durable material rather than a reissue of a single original album.",
